<title>USA: Consilium sues Honeywell.</title>
<headline>Consilium sues Honeywell.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif. 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Consilium Inc said Wednesday it has filed a lawsuit against Honeywell Inc for breach of contract.</p>
<p>The suit, filed in the Santa Clara County Superior Court of California, includes, breach of contract, unfair competition and defamation.</p>
<p>The contract involved was entered into in April 1993 and is a distributor and license agreement pertaining to Consilium's FlowStream MES product.</p>
<p>Consilium is a supplier of integrated manufacturing execution systems software and services.</p>
